{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1388764-gift-of-dreams-advise","id":1388764,"title":"Gift of Dreams Advise.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-15T14:46:56-07:00","id":1388764,"title":"Gift of Dreams Advise.","content":"Whats the net effect of the Gift likely to be on someones actions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T18:20:25-07:00","id":1388811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1388764-gift-of-dreams-advise#post1388764\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whats the net effect of the Gift likely to be on someones actions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Little context?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T18:34:13-07:00","id":1388814,"title":"","content":"Depends on the actual Dream and where that person is in life.<br /> <br /> It could be anywhere from a major life changing experience like in the movie Inception, or being ignored completely.<br /> <br /> As an ST, it really depends on where the NPC is in his life, the effort and quality of the PC's work on the dream he's planting (and relevance to the PC), and the needs of the plot/scenario/chronicle.<br /> <br /> However, I would be more inclined to make greater changes based on the spiritual needs of the NPC that the Garou PC is helping, rather than a more selfish need of the PC to change the NPC's mind for tactical reasons independent of that NPC's spiritual needs. This doesn't mean I won't have the NPC change his mind about something that affects the game (he keeps the factory and its jobs instead of outsourcing it; he decides not to cut down that forest for lumber). It's just I am more likely approve greater changes if it actually helps the NPC move on from some psychological drama as opposed to something that doesn't make sense psychologically for the NPC. It depends on the specifics. Unless there is a great psychological need the NPC is struggling with, it is easier for him to dismiss it as a strange dream as opposed to something with life changing meaning for him. Or an NPC who is more inclined to see dreams as prophetic or with deep meaning as opposed to the idea they are &quot;just dreams.&quot;<br /> <br /> Personally, I think the various Dream gifts of the Galliards don't get used much in play, and I think they are awesome and should be used more. So I would be more inclined to say &quot;yes&quot; to what PCs want to do with them. I might just need to help them with the elements I am looking for in order for me to say &quot;yes&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T22:55:10-07:00","id":1388849,"title":"","content":"Say a Kinfolk is being Difficult Regarding An Arranged Marriage<br /> <br /> A Well meaning but Foolish Politician is being used by Pentex.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.o